S|               THE EARTH                                                            
O|
N|               Spinning imperceptibly. From 300,000 miles out. We hurtle            
N,G|               towards it and past, in the lower quadrant, the SURFACE of           
N|               the MOON.  Almost like we are rushing towards:                       
O|
S|               EXT. PUP TENT - EVENING                                              
